n: 3.9.5.5
name: page-fault-record
kind: observation
is: The reading found no recorded wrong answer from jit-page.bml in its ten commits or the notes. A fault noted on 2026-11-24, a closure over locals mapped over 317 names that stops near its 1024th call with 'order: only numbers have an order', appears at the C lane's heat mark and not at the page's 4096. The note says the kernel fault is not repaired.
status: observed
