n: 3.9.5.6
name: cold-hot-band
kind: observation
is: The test jit-page-band.bml calls each defn of a family on 4000 inputs cold, then on the same 4000 again, so that heat passes 4096 and the rest of the pass runs as a page, and compares both passes through the printed value. It reads verdict 63 when its six claims land, with the default lanes and with the C loop lane held by FK_NO_F64.
status: observed
src: 2.17.10#1-20
limit: Read, not run. The test needs heat 4096 inside one process and is the page's only miscompile detector besides comparing lowered bytes with the emitter off.
