n: 3.9.9
name: drop
kind: hub
is: Five things the study would leave behind: three encoders, two heat lanes and two value models for one instruction set; the mirror door that mints walker nodes at emit time; process-wide state in the code and its table, with no release; an emitter failure that stops the user's program and a decline with no reason; and an outside linker as the only route to an executable.
